{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn11le13ob05re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "You're looking for some ways to change your lifestyle. You have some personal goals. If you become a volunteer, you may achieve many of them. Here's a list of reasons that may encourage you to spend some time helping others in a volunteer position.</p>You say to yourself: \u201cI must stay healthy\u201d. Volunteering is good for you. There are  both physical and mental rewards to volunteering. How? Primarily, by reducing stress. New studies show that if you focus on something or someone else rather than on yourself, your outlook will change, which may alter some stress-producing mechanisms in the body. There are other ways you become healthier by volunteering. That feeling of optimism or happiness, or that you have gained control of your fate helps make you a stronger person. It may even strengthen your immune system.</p>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "", "text": "You say to yourself: \u201cI have to do more to support my community\u201d. Volunteering strengthens your community while saving public dollars. Volunteers help provide numerous services in the community such as supporting youth, improving healthcare and making the neighborhood beautiful. Because of the hours volunteers spend on these projects, money can be funneled into local improvement projects. If you donate your time, local hospitals and community centers will be able to invest their precious resources in other areas.</p>\nYou say to yourself: \u201cI must get more practical work experience\u201d. Volunteering is a great way to gain experience. Try out a career path, pad your r\u00e9sum\u00e9, and get good references. For example, if you volunteer for a non-profit organization, you might learn something about how these organizations operate.</p>", "id": 2, "time": "49500"}, {"image": "", "text": "You say to yourself: \u201cI must be more social\u201d. As a volunteer, you help bring people together from all walks of life to achieve something important, which builds camaraderie and fosters teamwork.</p>\nYou say to yourself: \u201cI must work on my personal development\u201d. Volunteering enables you to grow as a person and boosts your self-esteem. It encourages engagement in the community and promotes civic responsibility. If you understand community needs, you may develop feelings of empathy and self-efficacy.</p>\nMost importantly, volunteering is about the people you help. You make a huge difference in the lives of many people.", "id": 3, "time": "99000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social issues, beliefs, opinions and moral or personal dilemmas.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express personal obligations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express that a fairly certain condition will be fulfilled.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Why do you think people become volunteers?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " If you are not a volunteer, where would you consider volunteering?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think that volunteering is important? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "ty